# Full-length Spotify playback (optional).
#
# Without this, the site plays Spotify's public 30-second previews — no setup,
# no login. With it, visitors can connect their own Spotify account and hear
# complete tracks. Each listener needs Spotify Premium; the SDK refuses to
# play on free accounts.
#
# To fill it in:
#   1. Create an app at https://developer.spotify.com/dashboard
#   2. Under Redirect URIs add BOTH:
#        http://127.0.0.1:3000/callback      (local dev — Spotify rejects
#                                             "localhost" over plain http)
#        https://your-domain.com/callback    (production)
#   3. Copy this file to .env.local and paste the client ID below.
#
# The client ID is public by design — PKCE means there is no secret to leak.

NEXT_PUBLIC_SPOTIFY_CLIENT_ID=
